<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44322" root="&#xA;                        هل&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْ</span></b> 
                         may be originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْو</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْى</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلّ</span>:
(Akh, in S, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بل</span>:) see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلْ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلْ</span> followed
by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلَى</span>: see the latter. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَىّ هَلَ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حى</span>.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَلَّا</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَضَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْ</span>, latter part, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْلَا</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَّا</span>.

